---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Article Categories
description: Explore ByteWise IT Tips guides by topic – Windows 11, hardware repair, Wi-Fi and networking, Microsoft 365, cybersecurity, Android, software, IT tutorials, AI tools and buying guides.
permalink: /categories/
breadcrumbs:
  - { label: "Home", url: "/" }
  - { label: "Categories", url: "/categories/" }
---
<div class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    {% include "partials/breadcrumbs.njk" %}
    <h1>Article categories</h1>
    <p class="lede">Pick a topic to see every guide we have published in it.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    {%- for c in categories %}
    {%- set list = collections.articles | byCategory(c.slug) %}
    <div class="section-head" style="margin-top:{{ '0' if loop.first else '48px' }}">
      <div>
        <h2><a href="/category/{{ c.slug }}/" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:none">{{ c.name }}</a></h2>
        <p>{{ c.description }}</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/category/{{ c.slug }}/">{{ list.length }} guide{% if list.length != 1 %}s{% endif %} →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid">{% for post in list | limit(3) %}{% include "partials/card.njk" %}{% endfor %}</div>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
